# Normalize line endings: the repository stores text files with LF, and they
# are checked out with LF on every platform. Keeps diffs clean and avoids the
# mixed CRLF/LF state a repo drifts into once one file is committed from a
# Windows editor — from then on any tool that rewrites it shows a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.pdb binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
